  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Lang Ya blessed land he opens a long distance from a yellow jade lion, raises his hand, and slashes. The blade hits the lion’s back. Blood splatters and quickly freezes solid. The blade shatters like glass, and the frost energy inside spreads into the lion’s body. The offense comes in multiple forms, overwhelming and hard to defend against. He uses it again. An armor of light from mortal Gu does not last a moment. A deep wound that reveals the bone is left on the lion’s back, and the lion sprawls on the ground.",
